WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.590
Two pigs, on either side of a barn floor.

2
00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:08.570
One stands on a crate, full of
speeches, committees and windmill plans.

3
00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:10.620
The other speaks little.

4
00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:13.350
In Chapter 3, he takes some puppies away,

5
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.190
to raise in private.

6
00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.670
Chapter 5.

7
00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.110
The vote on the windmill draws near.

8
00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:24.050
One signal, and nine huge dogs
chase Snowball off the farm.

9
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.810
Snowball is gone.

10
00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:28.860
Would the farm have been
better off with him in charge?

11
00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:33.240
In this mission, you'll compare two
very different styles of leadership.

12
00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:35.870
You'll replay the moment
Snowball is driven out,

13
00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.350
step by step.

14
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.260
And you'll test the evidence.

15
00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:42.030
Is Snowball simply the good pig?

16
00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:46.190
Your mission: decide whether
Snowball would have ruled any better.
